# Pre-registered DCR client on rm-trade-rec-mcp (persisted in reconciliationdb kv_store).
# SHAPE ONLY — the real pair was registered via the server's open /register endpoint
# and lives in the kv_store table of reconciliationdb (or re-register a fresh one the
# same way with the next.unique.app chat/admin callback URIs).
# Paste into the connector Authenticate modal only when the platform loops on
# "Client Not Registered" (see HANDOFF.md, platform-side stale-client gotcha).
CLIENT_ID=<dcr-client-id>
CLIENT_SECRET=<dcr-client-secret>
